# <type>(<scope>): <subject>   e.g. fix(parser): reject empty input
#
# What changed and why. One logical change per commit.
#
# The pull request (not each commit) carries the ADR line:
#   ADR: ADR-00NN        or   ADR: n/a, <reason>
# Agents add their trailer, e.g.:
#   Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
# Commits are signed (ADR-0006). Lines starting with # are ignored.
